  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO continues to provide technical support to Tonga to report on ratified conventions, including through in-country ILS workshops. ILO has prepared a gap analysis to identify potential gaps and challenges preventing ratification of C029 (Convention on Forced Labour). The analysis coves  laws, policies, and institutional capacities to prevent and address forced labour. The analysis will inform further ILO technical assistance to  support Tonga  in its efforts to combat forced labour and advance towards ratification.</narrative>
  </description>
